  entries:
  - key: boot_ready
    en: Ready
    tr: "Haz\u0131r"
  - key: loading_title
    en: Loading
    tr: "Y\xFCkleniyor"
  - key: tip_bark
    en: Break bark plates to expose the targets behind them.
    tr: "Arkas\u0131ndaki hedefleri a\xE7mak i\xE7in kabuk plakalar\u0131n\u0131
      k\u0131r."
  - key: tip_branch
    en: A broken branch drops the guardian standing on it.
    tr: "K\u0131r\u0131lan bir dal \xFCzerindeki muhaf\u0131z\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCr."
  - key: tip_core
    en: The Heartwood only takes full damage once its bark is gone.
    tr: "Kalp \xD6z\xFC ancak \xF6n\xFCndeki kabuk k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131nca tam hasar
      al\u0131r."
  - key: tip_special
    en: Special energy fills over time and with every hit.
    tr: "\xD6zel enerji zamanla ve her isabetle dolar."
  - key: tip_tools
    en: Tools have long cooldowns; save them for exposed targets.
    tr: "Ara\xE7lar\u0131n bekleme s\xFCresi uzundur; a\xE7\u0131k hedeflere sakla."
  - key: tip_upgrade
    en: Duplicate cards become shards for upgrades.
    tr: "Tekrar \xE7\u0131kan kartlar y\xFCkseltme par\xE7as\u0131na d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCr."
