    en: Gems
    tr: "M\xFCcevher"
  - key: currency_trophies
    en: Trophies
    tr: Kupa
  - key: currency_info_coins
    en: Coins come from battles, chests and quests. Spend them on guardian upgrades.
    tr: "Alt\u0131n sava\u015Flardan, sand\u0131klardan ve g\xF6revlerden gelir.
      Muhaf\u0131z y\xFCkseltmelerinde harcan\u0131r."
  - key: currency_info_sap
    en: Sap comes from battles and chests. Spend it on tree and tool upgrades.
    tr: "\xD6z sava\u015Flardan ve sand\u0131klardan gelir. A\u011Fa\xE7 ve ara\xE7
      geli\u015Ftirmelerinde harcan\u0131r."
  - key: currency_info_gems
    en: Gems are rare. Use them to skip chest timers.
    tr: "M\xFCcevher nadirdir. Sand\u0131k s\xFCrelerini atlamak i\xE7in kullan."
