  - key: tree_max_level
    en: Maximum level reached
    tr: "Maksimum seviyeye ula\u015F\u0131ld\u0131"
  - key: loadout_empty
    en: Equip at least one guardian to battle.
    tr: "Sava\u015Fmak i\xE7in en az bir muhaf\u0131z yerle\u015Ftir."
  - key: save_corrupt_title
    en: Save Problem
    tr: "Kay\u0131t Sorunu"
  - key: save_corrupt_body
    en: Your save file could not be read. A new save was created.
    tr: "Kay\u0131t dosyan okunamad\u0131. Yeni bir kay\u0131t olu\u015Fturuldu."
  - key: save_recovered_body
    en: Your save was restored from a backup.
    tr: "Kayd\u0131n yedekten geri y\xFCklendi."
  - key: reset_save_title
    en: Reset Progress?
    tr: "\u0130lerleme S\u0131f\u0131rlans\u0131n m\u0131?"
  - key: reset_save_body
    en: All progress will be lost. This cannot be undone.
    tr: "T\xFCm ilerleme silinecek. Bu geri al\u0131namaz."
