    en: Gains shield on hit
    tr: "Vurunca kalkan kazan\u0131r"
  - key: passive_heal
    en: Regenerates health
    tr: "Can\u0131n\u0131 yeniler"
  - key: passive_armor_aura
    en: Armor aura for allies
    tr: "M\xFCttefiklere z\u0131rh auras\u0131"
  - key: passive_tool_cd
    en: Tool cooldown -{0}%
    tr: "Ara\xE7 bekleme -%{0}"
  - key: passive_structure
    en: +{0}% structure damage
    tr: "+%{0} yap\u0131 hasar\u0131"
  - key: passive_rebirth
    en: Returns once after defeat
    tr: "Yenilince bir kez geri d\xF6ner"
  - key: t_root_catapult_name
    en: Root Catapult
    tr: "K\xF6k Manc\u0131n\u0131\u011F\u0131"
  - key: t_root_catapult_desc
    en: Lobs a heavy boulder that crushes structures.
    tr: "Yap\u0131lar\u0131 ezen a\u011F\u0131r bir kaya f\u0131rlat\u0131r."
  - key: t_dew_sprayer_name
    en: Dew Sprayer
    tr: "\xC7iy P\xFCsk\xFCrt\xFCc\xFC"
  - key: t_dew_sprayer_desc
    en: Heals a tree section and nearby guardians.
    tr: "Bir a\u011Fa\xE7 b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn\xFC ve yak\u0131n muhaf\u0131zlar\u0131
      iyile\u015Ftirir."
  - key: t_bee_hive_name
    en: Bee Hive
    tr: "Ar\u0131 Kovan\u0131"
  - key: t_bee_hive_desc
    en: Releases a homing swarm of bees.
    tr: "Y\xF6nlenen bir ar\u0131 s\xFCr\xFCs\xFC salar."
  - key: t_wind_bell_name
    en: Wind Bell
    tr: "R\xFCzg\xE2r \xC7an\u0131"
  - key: t_wind_bell_desc
    en: Deflects incoming projectiles slightly.
    tr: "Gelen mermileri hafif\xE7e sapt\u0131r\u0131r."
  - key: t_vine_net_name
    en: Vine Net
    tr: "Sarma\u015F\u0131k A\u011F\u0131"
  - key: t_vine_net_desc
    en: Slows and locks a target area.
    tr: "Hedef b\xF6lgeyi yava\u015Flat\u0131r ve kilitler."
  - key: t_seed_shield_name
    en: Seed Shield
    tr: "Tohum Kalkan\u0131"
  - key: t_seed_shield_desc
    en: A temporary barrier on a chosen section.
    tr: "Se\xE7ilen b\xF6l\xFCmde ge\xE7ici bariyer."
  - key: tools_equipped
    en: Equipped Tools
    tr: "Tak\u0131l\u0131 Ara\xE7lar"
  - key: tools_collection
    en: All Tools
    tr: "T\xFCm Ara\xE7lar"
  - key: tree_heartwood
    en: Heartwood Level
    tr: "Kalp \xD6z\xFC Seviyesi"
  - key: tree_heartwood_desc
    en: Increases total core health.
    tr: "Toplam ana can\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r."
  - key: tree_bark
    en: Bark Thickness
    tr: "Kabuk Kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
  - key: tree_bark_desc
    en: Increases armor of all sections.
    tr: "T\xFCm b\xF6l\xFCmlerin z\u0131rh\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r."
  - key: tree_branch
    en: Branch Durability
    tr: "Dal Dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131"
  - key: tree_branch_desc
    en: Increases branch health.
    tr: "Dal can\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r."
  - key: tree_root
    en: Root Strength
    tr: "K\xF6k G\xFCc\xFC"
  - key: tree_root_desc
    en: Reduces splash and shake damage.
    tr: "Alan ve sars\u0131nt\u0131 hasar\u0131n\u0131 azalt\u0131r."
  - key: tree_sap
    en: Sap Flow
    tr: "\xD6z Ak\u0131\u015F\u0131"
  - key: tree_sap_desc
    en: Faster special energy in battle.
    tr: "Sava\u015Fta \xF6zel enerji daha h\u0131zl\u0131 dolar."
  - key: tree_canopy
    en: Canopy Growth
    tr: "Ta\xE7 Geli\u015Fimi"
  - key: tree_canopy_desc
    en: Unlocks guardian and tool slots.
    tr: "Muhaf\u0131z ve ara\xE7 yuvalar\u0131 a\xE7ar."
  - key: tree_tier_sprouting
